      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I recommend prioritizing Zips 90212, 90213, and 90214 for the community center grants. Zip 90212 and 90213 present the highest need due to lower median incomes and significantly elevated crime rates, indicating high potential for social impact. Zip 90214 offers a balanced mix of lower-to-middle income with moderate crime, suggesting a good combination of community need and feasibility for long-term stability.",
