      "content": "Interesting. I noticed you didn't include 90210 or 90211 in your top three. If the goal is \"maximizing social impact,\" wouldn't investing in those higher-income, lower-crime areas help foster even more growth and create a more stable \"gold standard\" for the city? Why is the focus so heavily on the lower-income/higher-crime areas specifically?",
